# Dr. Denys Dutykh (Mathematics Department, Khalifa University of Science and Technology, Abu Dhabi, UAE)
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "WhatsApp2Minutes: the minutes of a committee from its WhatsApp chat"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dutykh
    given-names: Denys
    affiliation: "Khalifa University of Science and Technology"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5247-2788"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dutykh/WhatsApp2Minutes"
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
keywords:
  - whatsapp
  - chat-export
  - meeting-minutes
  - llm
  - text-processing
  - python
abstract: >-
  Python package, written with the standard library only, that turns the text export of a WhatsApp
  group into the documents of a committee: one file per day, a formal meeting document for each
  day written by a large language model (OpenAI, OpenRouter or Anthropic) with its attendees,
  agenda, summary, decisions and action items, and a short report on the activity of the committee
  over the whole chat.
